<title>THAILAND: Advance Agro to issue 10 bln baht bonds.</title>
<headline>Advance Agro to issue 10 bln baht bonds.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Advance Agro Plc said on Friday it will issue up to 10 billion baht $384.6 million) in bonds.</p>
<p>The company said in a statement to the Stock Exchange of Thailand the bonds will be issued in baht or in its equivalent in another currency.</p>
<p>Further details will be determined by the board, it said.</p>
<p>($1=26 baht)</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662) 652-0642</p>
